PARSFILE
#FullDataName Models: Simulink`Camera Sensor`Live Video
#RunMdlFile Extensions\Simulink\Camera_Sensor_CS2017.slx
#RingCtrl1 2
OPT_INT_METHOD 2
#CheckBox0 0    
*USE_ALT_DIR 0
#CheckBox1 0    
*USE_DIFF_SOLVERS 0
#CheckBox2 1    
OPT_IO_UPDATE 1
#CheckBox3 1    

*TSTEP 0.001
*FREQ_MODEL 1000
*TSTEP_OUT 0.025
*FREQ_OUT 40
tstep 0.001
iprint 25
#MiscYellow0
LIVE_SERVER 127.0.0.1
ANI_T_Stamp
#ENDMYellow

LIVE_SERVER_UPDATE_FREQ_MAX 60

#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This dataset links to a Simulink camera sensor model with an image processing to detect number of other cars on traffic and headway distance to a front vehicle.
#
#The camera sensor's image information is passed to the Simulink model, and headway distance and number of other cars are ditected by an image processing
#
#(Computer Vision System Toolbox is required).
#
#In this case, the time step is set at 0.001, the method is AM-2, and the option is checked to communicate with Simulink at an interval of 1/2 the time step (i.e., 0.0005 sec).
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

LOG_ENTRY Used Dataset: Models: Simulink; { Live Video } Camera Sensor
#Library : Models: Simulink
#DataSet : Camera Sensor
#Category: Live Video
#FileID  : Simlink_f3151a22-1654-4aaa-9333-107c38e44fdb
#Product : CarSim 2017.1
#VehCode 

